  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription> "SI base unit ampere divided by the 0.01-fold of the SI base unit metre" .

<http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E1L-1I0M0H0T0D0> a <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKindDimensionVector_SI>,
    <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKindDimensionVector_ISO>, <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKindDimensionVector_Imperial>;
