  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/uneceCommonCode> "P83" .

<http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L-2I0M1H0T-2D0> a <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKindDimensionVector_SI>,
