  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/qkdvNumerator> <http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L1I0M0H0T0D0> .

<http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L1I0M-1H0T2D0> a <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKindDimensionVector_SI>,
