  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription> "In epidemiology, incidence is a measure of the probability of occurrence of a given medical condition in a population within a specified period of time.";
  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/qkdvDenominator> <http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T1D0>;
  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/qkdvNumerator> <http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M0H0T0D1>;
