  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription> "Unit for measuring the hardware cost of substance or material" .

<http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M-1H0T0D0> a <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityKindDimensionVector_SI>,
