    <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/CGS-GAUSS>, <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/SI>, <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/CGS>;
  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/conversionMultiplier> 0.0000000002777778;
  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/conversionMultiplierSN> 2.777778E-10;
