  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/ucumCode> "daP"^^<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/UCUMcs>;
  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription> "10-fold of the CGS unit of the dynamic viscosity poise";
