  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector> <http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L0I0M1H0T-1D0>;
  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasQuantityKind> <http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/MassFlowRate>;
