  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasDimensionVector> <http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L3I0M0H0T-1D0>;
  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/hasQuantityKind> <http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/VolumeFlowRate>,
