  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription> "SI base unit kilogram divided by the product of the power of the SI base unit metre with the exponent 2 and the SI base unit second";
  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/exactMatch> unit:KiloGM-PER-M2-SEC .

