  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/uneceCommonCode> "L31";
  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription> "The roentgen equivalent man (or rem) is a CGS unit of equivalent dose, effective dose, and committed dose, which are measures of the health effect of low levels of ionizing radiation on the human body.";
