  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/latexDefinition> "$\\alpha_l = \\frac{1}{l} \\; \\frac{dl}{dT}$, where $l$ is $length$ and $T$ is thermodynamic temperature."^^<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString>;
  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/qkdvDenominator> <http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L1I0M0H1T0D0>;
