  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription> "\"Volume\" is the quantity of three-dimensional space enclosed by some closed boundary, for example, the space that a substance (solid, liquid, gas, or plasma) or shape occupies or contains.";
  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/latexDefinition> "$V = \\int\\int\\int dxdydz$, where $x$, $y$, and $z$ are cartesian coordinates."^^<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString>;
