  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol> "C_D";
  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription> "In fluid dynamics, the drag coefficient is a dimensionless quantity that is used to quantify the drag or resistance of an object in a fluid environment such as air or water.";
