  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/informativeReference> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heat_of_combustion"^^xsd:anyURI;
  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription> "The heating value (or energy value or calorific value) of a substance, usually a fuel or food (see food energy), is the amount of heat released during the combustion of a specified amount of it. ";
