  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription> "Requirement minus predicted value. Margin is used as a metric in risk management. Positive margin mitigates the risk of mass increases from requirements maturation and implementation, underestimated predicted system, or subsystem mass.";
  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/applicableUnit> unit:AMU, unit:U, unit:CARAT, unit:CWT_LONG,
