  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/symbol> "M^2";
  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription> "\"Migration Area\" is the sum of the slowing-down area from fission energy to thermal energy and the diffusion area for thermal neutrons.";
