  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription> "The amount of propellant mass within a stage that is available for impulse for use in nominal payload performance prediction. This mass excludes loaded propellant that has been set aside for off- nominal performance behavior (FPR and fuel bias).";
