  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/plainTextDescription> "Shear Strain is the amount of deformation perpendicular to a given line rather than parallel to it. ";
  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/latexSymbol> "$\\gamma$"^^<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString>;
  <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/latexDefinition> "$\\gamma = \\frac{\\Delta x}{d}$, where $\\Delta x$ is the parallel displacement between two surfaces of a layer of thickness $d$."^^<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString>;
