:c_868fb8ce a skos:Concept;
  skos:inScheme :conceptScheme_3e018a2a;
  skos:prefLabel "USACE"@en;
  skos:altLabel "US Army Corp of Engineers Access to Water"@en, "Access2Water"@en;
  skos:editorialNote """the params are being generated from this endpoint url  https://water.sec.usace.army.mil/cda/reporting/providers/projects?fmt=geojson

essentially what i am doing to get the list of params is just fetching all the locations, iterating through each location, and then using that to construct the list. this is since the geojson response from their API conveniently has the params already joined with the locations"""@en;
  skos:broader :c_1805cd26 .

